    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Devellin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a huge diamond to Kachua a while ago. Ever since then, all she's been talking about is diamonds and how much she wants them.",
      "translation" : "展示一顆巨大的鑽石。從那以後，她整天都在談論鑽石，說自己有多想要。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Devellin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Devellin]",
      "translation" : "[德維林]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Devellin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "She's been getting pretty obsessive about it, which scares me. It seems she's more than willing to sacrifice anything she owns for a diamond.",
      "translation" : "她越來越痴迷了，真讓人擔心。為了鑽石，她似乎願意拿自己擁有的一切去交換。"
