    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Devellin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Devellin]",
      "translation" : "[德維林]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Devellin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "She's the type of person who'll do anything to get what she wants. I'm worried that she might give away something far more valuable than a diamond in exchange...",
      "translation" : "她是那種為了得到想要的東西什麼都做得出來的人。我擔心她會拿比鑽石貴重得多的東西去交換..."
