      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 412,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Guy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "She's just totally in love with diamonds. And from what my sources tell me, she's loaded. Tons and tons of valuables.",
      "translation" : "她對鑽石簡直著了迷。據我的訊息，她非常有錢，家裡有成堆的貴重物品。"
