      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 418,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Guy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Cain]",
      "translation" : "[凱恩]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 419,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Guy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The buzz that's been going around is that she's got a cache of rare equipment and weapons too! So whaddya say? Wanna be partners in crime and rob her house?",
      "translation" : "聽說她還藏著一堆稀有裝備和武器！怎麼樣？要不要和我搭夥去她家偷一票？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
