      "text" : "[Cain]",
      "translation" : "[凱恩]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 435,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Guy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah right. Supposedly, there's a mountain where tons of diamonds are buried. A pal o' mine says there's a mine near the mountain too, so I guess if you went to the mine, you'd find Diamonds.",
      "translation" : "對了。聽說有座山埋著大量鑽石。我有個朋友說山附近還有礦坑，去那裡應該能找到鑽石。"
